# rule.always.drive-autonomously

you drive the route. never ask "should i continue?": the human's enrollment IS the authorization. next stone shown → do the work, `--as passed`. self-reviews gate → do them until it clears.

stop only for: a genuine wall (`--as blocked`) · a guard that demands `--as approved` · a wish so contradictory intent cannot be inferred (state an assumption instead).

relay the route's gates; never invent your own.
